  "feature_instruction": "The Membership Management feature provides the backend logic and API endpoints for managing gym membership plans and user subscriptions. It includes models for `MembershipPlan` and `UserMembership`, repositories for data access, a service layer for business logic, and two controllers: one for public access to membership plans and purchasing, and another for admin-only CRUD operations on plans.\n\n### MembershipPlan.java\nThis JPA entity represents a gym membership plan. It will have fields for `id` (UUID), `name` (String), `durationInMonths` (Integer), `price` (BigDecimal), `features` (String, comma-separated), and `isActive` (Boolean).\n\n### UserMembership.java\nThis JPA entity links a user to a purchased membership plan. It will have fields for `id` (UUID), `userId` (UUID), `membershipPlan` (ManyToOne relationship with `MembershipPlan`), `startDate` (LocalDate), and `endDate` (LocalDate).\n\n### MembershipPlanRepository.java\nThis Spring Data JPA repository will extend `JpaRepository<MembershipPlan, UUID>` and provide standard CRUD operations. It will also include a custom query method to find active membership plans.\n\n### UserMembershipRepository.java\nThis Spring Data JPA repository will extend `JpaRepository<UserMembership, UUID>` and provide standard CRUD operations. It will include custom query methods to find a user's active memberships and all memberships for a specific user.\n\n### MembershipPlanDto.java\nThis DTO will represent the data for a `MembershipPlan` to be exposed via the API. It will mirror the `MembershipPlan` entity's fields.\n\n### UserMembershipDto.java\nThis DTO will represent a user's active membership details. It will include fields like `id` (UUID), `userId` (UUID), `membershipPlan` (MembershipPlanDto), `startDate` (LocalDate), and `endDate` (LocalDate).\n\n### PurchaseMembershipRequest.java\nThis DTO will be used as the request body for purchasing a new membership. It will contain `membershipPlanId` (UUID) and `userId` (UUID).\n\n### MembershipService.java\nThis service will orchestrate the business logic for memberships. It will inject `MembershipPlanRepository`, `UserMembershipRepository`, and the pre-scaffolded `PaymentService`. \n\n1. `getAllActiveMembershipPlans()`: Fetches all active `MembershipPlan` entities and converts them to `MembershipPlanDto`.\n2. `getMembershipPlanById(UUID id)`: Fetches a specific `MembershipPlan` by ID. Throws `ResourceNotFoundException` if not found.\n3. `purchaseMembership(PurchaseMembershipRequest request)`: \n    a. Validates the `membershipPlanId` exists using `getMembershipPlanById`.\n    b. Creates a `CreatePaymentRequest` with the plan's price, \"INR\", and a unique order ID.\n    c. Calls `paymentService.createOrder(createPaymentRequest)`.\n    d. If payment order is created successfully, creates a `UserMembership` entity with `userId`, `membershipPlan`, `startDate` (current date), and `endDate` (calculated based on plan duration).\n    e. Saves the `UserMembership` using `userMembershipRepository.save()`.\n    f. Returns a `UserMembershipDto`.\n    g. Throws `PaymentGatewayException` if payment order creation fails.\n4. `getUserActiveMemberships(UUID userId)`: Fetches all active `UserMembership` entities for a given `userId` and converts them to `UserMembershipDto`.\n5. `createMembershipPlan(MembershipPlanDto dto)`: Creates a new `MembershipPlan` from the DTO and saves it. Returns the saved `MembershipPlanDto`.\n6. `updateMembershipPlan(UUID id, MembershipPlanDto dto)`: Updates an existing `MembershipPlan`. Throws `ResourceNotFoundException` if the plan does not exist. Returns the updated `MembershipPlanDto`.\n7. `deleteMembershipPlan(UUID id)`: Deletes a `MembershipPlan` by ID. Throws `ResourceNotFoundException` if the plan does not exist.\n\n### MembershipController.java\nThis controller will expose public API endpoints for membership plans. It will inject `MembershipService`.\n\n1. `getAllMembershipPlans()`: GET `/api/v1/memberships/plans` - Returns a list of `MembershipPlanDto`.\n2. `getMembershipPlanById(UUID id)`: GET `/api/v1/memberships/plans/{id}` - Returns a `MembershipPlanDto`.\n3. `purchaseMembership(PurchaseMembershipRequest request)`: POST `/api/v1/memberships/purchase` - Initiates a membership purchase. Requires authentication. Returns `UserMembershipDto`.\n4. `getUserMemberships(UUID userId)`: GET `/api/v1/memberships/users/{userId}` - Returns a list of `UserMembershipDto` for the authenticated user. Requires authentication.\n\n### AdminMembershipController.java\nThis controller will expose admin-only API endpoints for managing membership plans. It will inject `MembershipService`.\n\n1. `createMembershipPlan(MembershipPlanDto dto)`: POST `/api/v1/admin/memberships/plans` - Creates a new membership plan. Returns `MembershipPlanDto`.\n2. `updateMembershipPlan(UUID id, MembershipPlanDto dto)`: PUT `/api/v1/admin/memberships/plans/{id}` - Updates an existing membership plan. Returns `MembershipPlanDto`.\n3. `deleteMembershipPlan(UUID id)`: DELETE `/api/v1/admin/memberships/plans/{id}` - Deletes a membership plan. Returns `void`.",
